nd program coordination. View Details Bookmark Sycamore Video Associate News Director ST2600186 Student Media 08/31/2026 09/09/2026 No Along with the Sycamore Video News Director, the Sycamore Video Associate News Director  is responsible for all Organizational (Sycamore Video) News Production and produces news content for Sycamore Video and ISU Student Media as needed, and helps write and develop professional-sounding scripts for, but not limited to, The Week at ISU, Last WeekEND at ISU, Sycamore Video News Update (Social Med... View Details Bookmark Student Account Analyst ST2600185 Assoc VP Finance Asst Treasurer 08/31/2026 09/30/2026 No Will include accurately handling money, customer service, copying, filing, and other duties as assigned in the area. View Details Bookmark Chemistry Teaching Assistant ST2600184 Chemistry & Physics 08/31/2026 09/30/2026 No A Teaching Assistant will assist a faculty instructor in the Chemistry teaching laboratory, including with the grading of lab reports and exams. View Details Bookmark Development Student Assistant ST2600182 Advancement 08/31/2026 09/30/2026 Yes The Development Student Assistant will work closely with the development team within the Division of University Advancement to help with the cultivation and stewardship of new donors. View Details Bookmark Community-Engaged Alliance Student Researcher ST2600181 Political Science 08/31/2026 09/30/2026 No Students employed for this position will support a grant-funded community engagement project funded by Community-Engaged Alliance. The project has two primary goals. The first is to develop recommendations for programs that could be implemented in the Wabash Valley to address intergenerational poverty. The second is to explore the potential of using Ryves Hall in Terre Haute as a special needs ... View Details Bookmark Computer Technician II ST2600180 HISTORICAL Office of Information Technology 08/31/2026 09/30/2026 No This job will involve training for Computer Repair or