n or visit the University. View Details Bookmark Sodexo Cook I ST2600157 Sodexo - Sycamore Towers 08/24/2026 09/24/2026 No The Cook I will accurately and efficiently prepare, portion, cook, and present a variety of hot and/or cold food items for various meal periods: to include Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner, and Special/Catered Events. The general responsibilities of the position include those listed below, but Sodexo may identify other responsibilities of the position. These responsibilities may differ among accounts, ... View Details Bookmark Food Service Employee I ST2600156 Sodexo - Sycamore Towers 08/24/2026 09/24/2026 No The Food Service Employee I may work anywhere on property where food is prepared. This person will assist in setup and serving of food from counters and steamtables. Duties will include cleaning and sanitizing equipment and work stations. The general responsibilities of the position include those listed below, but Sodexo may identify other responsibilities of the position. These responsibilitie... View Details Bookmark ISUcceed Undergraduate Academic Mentor ST2600174 Charles E Brown Cultural Center 08/27/2026 09/27/2026 No To work with incoming freshmen and transfer students and help them acclimate to the Indiana State University setting. View Details Bookmark Terre Haute Children's Museum Before & After-school Program Assistant ST2600162 Off-Campus Work Study 08/24/2026 09/24/2026 No Assist with implementing before and/or after-school programs at Deming Early Learning Center, 1750 8th Ave. Terre Haute, IN. View Details Bookmark CEBCC Student Assistant ST2600173 Charles E Brown Cultural Center 08/24/2026 09/24/2026 No The Charles E. Brown Cultural Center (CEBCC) Student Assistant is responsible for promoting positive identification, association, and relationship tothe historical and contemporary cultures included within the cultural center portfolio. Administrative, promotional, programming and other front desk and clerical duties are included. View Details Bookmark Chemistry Laboratory Assistant ST2600172 Chemistry & Physics 08/24/2026 09/24/2026 No A Laboratory Assistant will assist a faculty instructor in the chemistry teaching laboratory. View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 3 4 5 Next To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
