d work stations. The general responsibilities of the position include those listed below, but Sodexo may identify other responsibilities of the position. These responsibilitie... View Details Bookmark ISUcceed Undergraduate Academic Mentor ST2600174 Charles E Brown Cultural Center 08/27/2026 09/27/2026 No To work with incoming freshmen and transfer students and help them acclimate to the Indiana State University setting. View Details Bookmark CEBCC Student Assistant ST2600173 Charles E Brown Cultural Center 08/24/2026 09/24/2026 No The Charles E. Brown Cultural Center (CEBCC) Student Assistant is responsible for promoting positive identification, association, and relationship tothe historical and contemporary cultures included within the cultural center portfolio. Administrative, promotional, programming and other front desk and clerical duties are included. View Details Bookmark Chemistry Laboratory Assistant ST2600172 Chemistry & Physics 08/24/2026 09/24/2026 No A Laboratory Assistant will assist a faculty instructor in the chemistry teaching laboratory. View Details Bookmark Chemistry Teaching Assistant ST2600171 Chemistry & Physics 08/24/2026 09/24/2026 No A Teaching Assistant will assist a faculty instructor in the Chemistry teaching laboratory, including with the grading of lab reports and exams. View Details Bookmark Advancement Services Student Assistant ST2600168 ISU Foundation Operations 08/24/2026 09/24/2026 No Student processes data of constituent database. Scanning documents. Front Desk coverage. View Details Bookmark Primary Arts Instructor ST2600167 Community School of the Arts 08/24/2026 09/24/2026 No Instructor teaches CSA offerings to children or adults in the discipline of music, art or theater. View Details Bookmark Community School of the Arts Office and Events Assistant ST2600166 Community School of the Arts 08/24/2026 09/24/2026 No Assist the Office Administrative Assistant with registrations, mailings and some summer camp duties. View Details